OL,3,GNEWSARise in number of homes generating
OL,4,Apower
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a rise in the number of
OL,7,Fhomes generating electricity, typically
OL,8,Fthrough solar panels, according to a
OL,9,Fgovernment report.
OL,11,FThe Jersey Energy Trends Report, which
OL,12,Ftracks trends in the island's energy
OL,13,Fsupply, showed 99 more homes and
OL,14,Fbusinesses were generating electricity
OL,15,Fat the end of 2025 compared to the
OL,16,Fbeginning of the same year.
OL,18,FThere has also been an increase in use
OL,19,Fof biofuels as more firms and
OL,20,Fhouseholds are starting to more away
OL,21,Ffrom fossil fuels, the report shows.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
